uutils awk is a cross-platform implementation of the AWK language in
Rust.

This package installs ${PREFIX}/bin/gawk, the name used by lang/gawk.
It conflicts with lang/gawk and declares it as a secondary pkgpath, so
the package tools accept it as a provider of that path.  The GNU
package must not be installed at the same time.

It is a young, mostly POSIX implementation: GNU extensions, the
gawk-specific profiling and debugger interfaces, and the auxiliary
gawkbug, grcat and pwcat programs are not provided.
